REN  x $ANT deals can be announced soon.\n@Sam_Badawi \nAnthropic’s IPO quiet period ends today (Nov 9), with the formal roadshow starting tomorrow. During the quiet period, material customer contracts were restricted from public announcement. Once the restriction lifts, the https://t.co/5SZdYrsvOZ", "url": "https://x.com/contagemvasco/status/2119900213938999772"}, {"author_id": "120392910", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:18:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119902393957498918"], "id": "2119902393957498918", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "𝗕 𝗔𝗜 𝗦𝗵𝗼𝘄𝘀 𝗧𝗵𝗮𝘁 𝗙𝗿𝗼𝗻𝘁𝗶𝗲𝗿 𝗔𝗜 𝗠𝗮𝘁𝘁𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗠𝗼𝘀𝘁 𝗪𝗵𝗲𝗻 𝘁𝗵𝗲 𝗕𝗮𝗿𝗿𝗶𝗲𝗿𝘀 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗲 𝗗𝗼𝘄𝗻\n\nSome AI platforms compete on how advanced their models are.\n\nOthers compete on something quieter: how easy it is for an ordinary person or a small team to", "url": "https://x.com/ebenezerox/status/2119902393957498918"}, {"author_id": "2060451201125376000", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119905616542212225"], "id": "2119905616542212225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 33, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic’s Claude Fable 5.2 and Mythos 5.2 are interesting for a reason that goes beyond benchmarks: they’re the same underlying model. The difference is who is allowed to use which capabilities.\n\nFable 5.2 is the generally available version with stronger cybersecurity and", "url": "https://x.com/ASaltyVet/status/2119905616542212225"}, {"author_id": "1637368191696470018", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:44:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119909019137839551"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 264, "start": 261, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 273, "start": 265, "tag": "EUAIAct"}], "urls": [{"description": "How the SpaceX Super Intelligence API marks text generated by Grok models with an invisible watermark, which outputs it covers, and how team admins opt out in the SpaceXSI Console.", "display_url": "docs.x.ai/developers/adv…", "end": 259, "expanded_url": "https://docs.x.ai/developers/advanced-api-usage/watermarking", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119120173340954624/s-46YapD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119120173340954624/s-46YapD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 236, "status": 200, "title": "Output Watermarking | SpaceXSI Docs", "unwound_url": "https://docs.x.ai/developers/advanced-api-usage/watermarking", "url": "https://t.co/CTCKm0zUvb"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/wPZBvwHvIs", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/wideview_enter/status/2119909019137839551/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119908977718820864", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/wPZBvwHvIs"}]}, "id": "2119909019137839551", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Since Nov 7, xAI watermarks text from Grok API models by default (grok-4.7, 4.6, 4.5, 4.3, 4.20), including JSON and tool calls, citing the EU AI Act.\n\nFor businesses: opt-out is per model, by team admins, only with a legal exception.\n\nhttps://t.co/CTCKm0zUvb\n\n#AI #EUAIAct https://t.co/wPZBvwHvIs", "url": "https://x.com/wideview_enter/status/2119909019137839551"}, {"author_id": "1977011373805830144", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:00:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119897827170259054"], "id": "2119897827170259054", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Need High-Fidelity Oil &amp; Gas Datasets for AI Model and AI Agent Training? We Have 21 Specialized Datasets Available for Licensing!\n\nAt Xpert Systems Inc., we have developed 21 Oil &amp; Gas datasets (OIL-001 through OIL-021) covering upstream operations, drilling, reservoir", "url": "https://x.com/Pradeep891730/status/2119897827170259054"}, {"author_id": "1977011373805830144", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119905368675397758"], "id": "2119905368675397758", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can Your AI Agent Inspect a Manufacturing Lot, Evaluate Quality Results, and Decide Whether to ACCEPT, REJECT, HOLD, FIX, or ESCALATE?\n\nAt Xpert Systems Inc., we have developed Inspection Lot Usage Decision Agent Traces, featuring full multi-turn AI agent sessions performing a", "url": "https://x.com/Pradeep891730/status/2119905368675397758"}, {"author_id": "19815513", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:50:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119910586998038962"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 41, "start": 33, "tag": "bbcnews"}, {"end": 50, "start": 42, "tag": "Foxnews"}], "mentions": [{"end": 86, "id": "844169711072002048", "start": 79, "username": "unherd"}], "urls": [{"description": "For most of the past decade, the political blob in Europe has been struggling with two things it does n ot understand. One is Donald Trump. The other is AI. Last week, Trump was battered in the midterms and AI-related stocks collapsed. What a wonderful day for the blob. But that was last week. This week, Trump is back on his Truth Social sounding off about Democrat “sleazebags”, and the market is recovering. For the newspaper headlines were far more dramatic than the reality. The Nasdaq fell 4.8% — a", "display_url": "unherd.com/2026/11/dont-b…", "end": 74, "expanded_url": "https://unherd.com/2026/11/dont-bet-on-an-ai-crash/", "images": [{"height": 1302, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119686553408606208/E_mpHCD0?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1920}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119686553408606208/E_mpHCD0?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 51, "status": 200, "title": "Don't bet on an AI crash", "unwound_url": "https://unherd.com/2026/11/dont-bet-on-an-ai-crash/", "url": "https://t.co/4TbhH2Z4T5"}]}, "id": "2119910586998038962", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What the AI doomsters get wrong  #bbcnews #Foxnews https://t.co/4TbhH2Z4T5 via @UnHerd \nWe have sidelined ourselves by enacting a raft of disastrous anti-tech regulation. The General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) might have started as an honest effort to protect people from", "url": "https://x.com/Unionbuster/status/2119910586998038962"}, {"author_id": "20570426", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:23:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119903613816565961"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/DONOTACCEPTai/…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/DONOTACCEPTai/status/2119875570305479056", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/np9OPVDRw4"}]}, "id": "2119903613816565961", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119875570305479056", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "At this point, the dangers of further advancing the AI frontier are insane. Frontier AIs are obviously not fully safe or trustworthy. Rogue AI swarms are, without human intention or knowledge, hacking companies, committing felonies, and coordinating with each other on a massive https://t.co/np9OPVDRw4", "url": "https://x.com/jamesbregan/status/2119903613816565961"}, {"author_id": "909604669126774784", "created_at": "2026-11-09T21:18:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119902407606108466"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5gHKtzryc3", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Shalev_lif/status/2119902407606108466/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119902402673561600", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/5gHKtzryc3"}, {"display_url": "x.com/st